        linkml:ClassDefinition ;
    skos:definition "A definition of an encounter type in this study, ie, an event at which data was collected about a participant, an intervention was made, or information about a participant was recorded. This may be something planned by a study or a type of data collection." ;
    skos:inScheme <https://includedcc.org/common-access-model> .

