<https://w3id.org/anvilproject/acr-harmonized-data-model/EnumFileHashType#CAMO%3A0000022> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "CAMO:0000022" ;
    dcterms:title "ETag" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf acr_harmonized_data_model:EnumFileHashType,
        linkml:PermissibleValue ;
    skos:altLabel "etag" ;
    skos:definition "The entity tag is a hash of the object. The ETag reflects changes only to the contents of an object, not its metadata. The ETag may or may not be an MD5 digest of the object data." .

<https://w3id.org/anvilproject/acr-harmonized-data-model/EnumFileHashType#MS%3A1000568> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "MS:1000568" ;
    dcterms:title "MD5" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf acr_harmonized_data_model:EnumFileHashType,
        linkml:PermissibleValue ;
    skos:altLabel "md5" ;
    skos:definition "MD5 (Message-Digest algorithm 5) is a (now deprecated) cryptographic hash function with a 128-bit hash value used to check the integrity of files." .

<https://w3id.org/anvilproject/acr-harmonized-data-model/EnumFileHashType#MS%3A1000569> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "MS:1000569" ;
    dcterms:title "SHA-1" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf acr_harmonized_data_model:EnumFileHashType,
        linkml:PermissibleValue ;
    skos:altLabel "sha1" ;
    skos:definition "SHA-1 (Secure Hash Algorithm-1) is a cryptographic hash function designed by the National Security Agency (NSA). It is also used to verify file integrity. Since 2011 it has been deprecated by the NIST as a U. S. government standard." .

<https://w3id.org/anvilproject/acr-harmonized-data-model/EnumFileHashType#MS%3A1003151> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "MS:1003151" ;
    dcterms:title "SHA-256" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf acr_harmonized_data_model:EnumFileHashType,
        linkml:PermissibleValue ;
    skos:definition "SHA-256 (member of Secure Hash Algorithm-2 family) is a cryptographic hash function designed by the National Security Agency (NSA) and published by the NIST as a U. S. government standard. It is also used to verify file integrity." .

